1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:04,629
Welcome to Melody and
Barnaby's Music Nuggets!

2
00:00:05,629 --> 00:00:11,038
Today we are going to learn
about the C major chord.

3
00:00:13,038 --> 00:00:19,096
And this is our friend… Harmony!
She loves notes that play together.

4
00:00:19,696 --> 00:00:25,012
A group of notes played
together has a name… a chord.

5
00:00:27,612 --> 00:00:32,091
Just the right hand… the
left hand comes later.

6
00:00:32,591 --> 00:00:35,864
Put your thumb… on Middle C.

7
00:00:38,464 --> 00:00:44,987
Press fingers one… three…
and five… all together!

8
00:00:47,087 --> 00:00:49,523
That is the C major chord.

9
00:00:50,623 --> 00:00:51,723
C

10
00:00:51,773 --> 00:00:52,748
E

11
00:00:52,798 --> 00:00:53,998
G

12
00:00:56,995 --> 00:00:58,966
Miss out a finger…

13
00:00:59,266 --> 00:01:01,145
That is a skip.

14
00:01:01,345 --> 00:01:06,150
Two skips… stacked up… make a chord.

15
00:01:10,550 --> 00:01:14,333
Notes together… stack
on top of each other.

16
00:01:16,433 --> 00:01:20,588
Harmony's tummy… shows
the C major chord!

17
00:01:25,188 --> 00:01:26,741
Play with me!

18
00:01:33,141 --> 00:01:36,414
Your turn! Look and listen.

19
00:01:36,814 --> 00:01:39,482
Which three fingers play the chord?

20
00:01:43,882 --> 00:01:45,082
One.

21
00:01:45,332 --> 00:01:46,532
Three.

22
00:01:46,922 --> 00:01:48,122
Five.

23
00:01:50,318 --> 00:01:53,265
Together… or one by one?

24
00:01:57,365 --> 00:01:58,733
Together!

25
00:02:00,733 --> 00:02:03,123
Is this the C major chord?

26
00:02:07,223 --> 00:02:08,423
Yes!

27
00:02:09,259 --> 00:02:10,581
You've got it!

28
00:02:12,281 --> 00:02:13,742
Now it's your turn!

29
00:02:13,942 --> 00:02:17,446
Play Build the Chord
and make the chord!

30
00:02:19,246 --> 00:02:23,556
Grown-ups, subscribe so
you never miss a Nugget.

31
00:02:23,606 --> 00:02:26,791
New ones every Wednesday and Saturday.

32
00:02:27,091 --> 00:02:29,481
See you for the next Nugget!

